title: Strike: the Government's Answer
subtitle: An urgent card: the unions strike, and our cabinet has to answer.
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && typeof PolishUnions !== 'undefined' && PolishUnions.govStrikeAvailable(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.strike (Z — 1.12, decision 7A of 8 XI 2026; P): while PPS sits in the cabinet, a dispute over wages is a strike the
// unions start on their own, and the government answers here for no month: meet the demands, arbitration, an order to end it, or
// nothing (the card comes back; after three months without an answer the strike collapses).
PolishUnions.govStrikeView(Q);
!}

= [+ pl_gstr_title +]

[+ pl_gstr_text +]

- @meet
- @arbitration
- @order
- @nothing

@meet
title: Meet the demands
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget unit. Wages rise for two months, the unions and the workers trust PPS more, but business presses harder.
choose-if: {! return PolishUnions.govStrikeStatus(Q, 'meet').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_gstr_meet_why +]
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_gstr_result = PolishUnions.govStrikeChoose(Q, 'meet');
!}
go-to: result

@arbitration
title: Call an arbitration
subtitle: A compromise at no cost: wages rise by half of what the unions demand, the unions trust PPS a little more, and business presses a little harder.
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_gstr_result = PolishUnions.govStrikeChoose(Q, 'arbitration');
!}
go-to: result

@order
title: Order the end of the strike
subtitle: No rise: the unions feel betrayed, and the Left of PPS protests.
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_gstr_result = PolishUnions.govStrikeChoose(Q, 'order');
!}
go-to: result

@nothing
title: Do nothing
subtitle: The strike goes on and output falls; the card comes back next month. A strike left without an answer for three months collapses, and the unions trust PPS less.
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_gstr_result = PolishUnions.govStrikeChoose(Q, 'nothing');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= [+ pl_gstr_title +]

[+ pl_gstr_result +]

- @root: Continue.
